      "message": "We use presence or absence of a token (that is, #ifdef / #ifndef) rather than defining a token to 0 or 1.\n\nHere, this should be \n\n#ifdef CONFIG_JTAG\n\nAnd then CONFIG_JTAG should be #undef\u0027d in include/config.h, which maintains the canonical list of all config options.  build.mk can then also only compile in jtag.c if CONFIG_JTAG is enabled.",
